Basically, on a nethack server, while watching another person's game,
you can press a to bring up the assist menu.  Then, you can choose
from a list of things that affects the player you are watching.  This
will make nethack more like a multiplayer game.   There would also be
a limit to assisting.  There is also an option to turn it off if you
are bugged by it.

What do you think of this idea?


